# CFAE System Framework v4.0.0 — KernelSU capability policy notes.
# No permissive mode or broad sysfs allow rule is installed.
# The root-manager su domain supplies the authority used by coreflowd.
# Nodes denied by the active SELinux policy are reported as per-actuator
# PermissionDenied capabilities and skipped without blocking independent domains.
# Do not add wildcard allow rules for sysfs, procfs, thermal, backlight or DRM.
